title: Clipboard written without a click
severity: medium
score: 25
tags: suspicious-clipboard
attack: T1204.004, T1115
description: The page wrote non-command text to the clipboard with no user gesture behind
  it. Copy buttons, share links and coupon codes copy on a click. A write that nobody asked
  for is how a lure pre-loads what it will tell the visitor to paste.
---
// Text the page put on the clipboard with no click behind it, when none of it is a
// command (clipboard_command_tampering covers commands).
no_gesture_writes
| where not(exists(clipboard_commands))
| project text = substring(text, 0, 300), api, frame_url
